# Files and patterns stow should NEVER modify
# Glob syntax: * matches any non-/ chars, ** matches any path

**/.gitkeep
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/opencode-notifier.json
**/opencode-notifier-state.json
**/.playwright-mcp
.config/ghostty/local_config     # generated by installer

# Claude sessions & state — stow must NEVER symlink these
**/.claude/projects/
**/.claude/sessions/
**/.claude/cache/
**/.claude/backups/
**/.claude/downloads/
**/.claude/.credentials.json
**/.claude/history.jsonl
**/.claude/shell-snapshots/
**/.claude/todos/
**/.claude/tasks/
